efense for LLM Agents\",\n    \"description\": \"Introduces lightweight and effective memory injection defense for LLM agents via intent-aware information bottleneck to protect against prompt injection attacks.\",\n    \"author\": \"Dongyi Liu et al.\",\n    \"source\": \"ArXiv\",\n    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28103\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-31\",\n    \"topics\": [\"AI safety\", \"prompt injection\", \"security\", \"LLM agents\", \"defense\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"DataClawEval: Benchmark for Data Engineering Agents\",\n    \"description\": \"Provides a benchmark for data engineering agents in real industrial harness for evaluating AI agents performing data engineering tasks.\",\n    \"author\": \"Debin Meng et al.\",\n    \"source\": \"ArXiv\",\n    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28033\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-31\",\n    \"topics\": [\"AI agents\", \"data engineering\", \"benchmarks\", \"evaluation\", \"industrial applications\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Beyond Rephrasing: Synthetic Textbook Data for Mid-Training\",\n    \"description\": \"Demonstrates how book-level organization improves synthetic textbook data for mid-training of language models using structured educational content.\",\n    \"author\": \"Jiawen Tao et al.\",\n    \"source\": \"ArXiv\",\n    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28109\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-31\",\n    \"topics\": [\"LLM training\", \"synthetic data\", \"education\", \"mid-training\", \"data generation\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Distilling Answer Set Programming from LLMs\",\n    \"description\": \"Explores distilling answer set programming theories from large language models to extract formal logic programs from neural models.\",\n    \"author\": \"Nelson Higuera Ruiz et al.\",\n    \"source\": \"ArXiv\",\n    \"url\": \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.28086\",\n    \"publ