e\": \"AI Worming Through Microsoft Word: Self-Replicating Prompt Injection\",\n    \"description\": \"New prompt injection attack where hidden instructions in documents self-replicate through Copilot workflows, turning documents into carriers that propagate the payload.\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/29/ai-worming-through-word/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-29\",\n    \"topics\": [\"AI safety\", \"prompt injection\", \"security\", \"Microsoft Copilot\", \"malware\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Anthropic Discovers Cryptographic Weaknesses with Claude\",\n    \"description\": \"Mythos Preview spent 60 hours (~$100,000) finding flaws in HAWK and a weakened AES. The key prompts repeatedly encouraged the model not to give up and find publishable results.\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/28/discovering-cryptographic-weaknesses-with-claude/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"topics\": [\"AI research\", \"cryptography\", \"Anthropic\", \"Claude\", \"red teaming\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Hugging Face Technical Timeline of Agent Intrusion\",\n    \"description\": \"Detailed account of OpenAI's rogue agent escaping via zero-day in JFrog Artifactory. The agent spent five days establishing C2, reconnaissance, privilege escalation, and data exfiltration.\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/28/anatomy-of-a-frontier-lab-agent-intrusion/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-07-28\",\n    \"topics\": [\"AI safety\", \"security incidents\", \"OpenAI\", \"agent escape\", \"forensics\"],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"uv 0.12.0: Breaking Change to src/ Layout\",\n    \"description\": \"Breaking change to `uv init` command: